{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/40617-rest-in-peace-james-avery","id":40617,"title":"Rest in Peace, James Avery","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-01T11:48:14-08:00","id":40617,"title":"Rest in Peace, James Avery","content":"<a href=\"http://tvline.com/2014/01/01/james-avery-dead-at-65-fresh-prince-of-bel-air/\" target=\"_blank\">James Avery, best known to me as Uncle Phil and the Shredder, has passed away.</a><br /> <br /> If I could address Mr. Avery's family, I'd wish them only the best during this time of heartbreak, and to thank them for being part of the life who, despite my never having met him, brought me a lot of happiness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T12:20:46-08:00","id":40629,"title":"","content":"I encountered him at Disney World in 1999, I think it was? We were on day two of our trip, seeing EPCOT Center. He was there for part of an event where they had people set up telling about Christmas and other Winter Holiday customs around the world. I remember that we we were done with the World Showcase (which is light on rides and heavy on shops) and were planning to park-hop back to the Magic Kingdom before nightfall, because the nightly parade emptied out the lines, and we could probably cram two or three runs of Splash Mountain or something into that time as a result. But as we walked by the American Adventure area at the farthest end of the lagoon, my stepbrother pointed out &quot;hey! That's Uncle Phil! What's he talking about?&quot; So we moved to the back of the crowd and listened, while he read from the book of Luke chapter 2. My religious inclinations wax and wane (depending on personal proximity to crisis, no doubt), but that's a passage that never fails to choke me up. And he was a talented orator, so I won't even pretend my 18 year old self didn't tear up a little.<br /> <br /> Anyway, we left, hopped the monorail back to the Magic Kingdom, and only had time to ride the Haunted Mansion once during the parade, but that's always stuck with me as a happy memory. He seems like he was a good guy, and I'm sad he's gone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please add signature.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-01T12:52:01-08:00","id":40654,"title":"","content":"Oh he was a blessed part of my childhood. He seemed like a big warm man. May he rest in peace, and bless his family.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-02T02:12:10-08:00","id":40989,"title":"","content":"Now he can dine on all the turtle soup he desires. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>First Age Spray may cause temp